      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-1be194815474be01733b25a2",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "针对主要疗效指标的缺失还将采用末次观察结转（Last Observational Carried Forward，LOCF）、无应答填补（Non-Response Imputation，NRI）法等进行敏感性分析。",
